        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. The writ petition is therefore disposed of with the following directions:\n(i) The petitioners shall remit an amount of 3 lakhs on or before 30.03.2024."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "aa0ac914318147fd821beff5820090b6_31",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
